  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Once, you knew your home. Then one day the Mists rose and carried you into a Domain of Dread. Since then, you have wandered from domain to domain, braving the fickle Mists in search of a way back. These cursed lands have changed you, but you take comfort in the communities of fellow wanderers scattered throughout the Mists.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Dexterity, Constitution, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> A Dark Gift feat of your choice (@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.8hKS95aCSXFbSlo6]{Mist Walker} is recommended)</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Survival and Stealth</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Artisan's Tools</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) Artisan's Tools (same as above), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLamp0000000]{Lamp}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (5 flasks), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPouch000000]{Pouch}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagTinderbox00]{Tinderbox}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 30 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
